//! Do not edit by hand.
//!
//! COMPOSITION LAW: every stratus witness valve refuses with a refusal class
//! from the strata-valve-pack taxonomy (module family `Strata.Valve.Refusals`),
//! and register/valve pairing is closed (every st:guardedBy edge resolves to
//! a valve carrying a refusal emission edge). The pinned taxonomy constants
//! are mirrored by IRI literal — no owl:imports, house style. Gate:
//! gates/020_valve_taxonomy_binding.rq (fail-closed).
